#: ../../source/index.rst:5 2b5da694212948d9817aa8947b2cf20e
msgid "ArduPilot AntennaTracker"
msgstr "ArduPilot AntennaTracker"

#: ../../source/index.rst:10 4663dca2bafb4da2beac94474c0392ef
msgid ""
"`Canberra UAV's tracker used during the 2014 OutBack Challenge "
"<http://www.suasnews.com/outback-challenge-2014/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Canberra UAV 在 2014 OutBack Challenge 比赛中使用的跟踪器 "
"<http://www.suasnews.com/outback-challenge-2014/>`__"

#: ../../source/index.rst:12 d6bae71d176a4576802a046822db7fad
msgid ""
"The *AntennaTracker* Project offers firmware for using a supported flight "
"controller board as an Antenna Tracker. This tracker determines the position"
" of a remote vehicle via its own GPS data and telemetry data from a Copter, "
"Rover, or Plane, and uses this information to align a directional antenna "
"towards the vehicle. Such alignment *significantly* enhances the "
"transmission and reception range from a ground station."
msgstr ""
"*AntennaTracker* 项目提供固件，让支持的飞控板可作为天线跟踪器使用。该跟踪器结合自身 GPS 数据与来自 Copter、Rover 或 "
"Plane 的数传数据，估计远端载具位置，并以此驱动定向天线对准载具。这样的对准能 *显著* 提升地面站的发射与接收距离。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 239febab366c47509c8d5b2ab4c41350
msgid ""
"Developers interested in AntennaTracker are invited to join the ArduPilot "
"Discord channel accessible in the Community menu. Users seeking "
"AntennaTracker support should refer to the support forums under the same "
"menu. This manual serves as a guide for setup and configuration."
msgstr ""
"有兴趣参与 AntennaTracker 开发的开发者，可加入 Community 菜单下的 ArduPilot Discord 频道。寻求 "
"AntennaTracker 支持的用户请参见同一菜单下的支持论坛。本手册作为安装与配置指南。"

